<title>USA: Regent Bancshares sees modest Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Regent Bancshares sees modest Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regent Bancshares Corp said on Tuesday that it would show a loss of less than $200,000 after extraordinary costs for a stock offering, a reorganization and other non recurring costs.</p>
<p>In last year's first quarter, the company reported net income of $217,792, or $0.05 a share.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering one million shares of common stock to accredited investors for $8.50 a share in a private placement.</p>
</text>
